OL,3,GNEWSAThe Lower Thames Crossing's carbon
OL,4,Aneutral ambition                       
OL,6,FThe Lower Thames Crossing will be the  
OL,7,Ffirst major project in the UK to be    
OL,8,Fcarbon neutral in construction,        
OL,9,FNational Highways has said.            
OL,11,FThe new road will connect Kent and     
OL,12,FEssex through a tunnel beneath the     
OL,13,FRiver Thames and is expected to almost 
OL,14,Fdouble road capacity, according to the 
OL,15,Fgovernment company.                    
OL,17,FNational Highways said diesel had not  
OL,18,Fbeen used on the worksites since 2025  
OL,19,Fand the tunnels and road were being    
OL,20,Fbuilt using only hydrotreated vegetable
OL,21,Foil, electric and hydrogen-powered     
OL,22,Fmachinery.                             
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
