OL,3,GNEWSAThe Lower Thames Crossing's carbon
OL,4,Aneutral ambition                       
OL,6,FAndrea Griffiths, director of the Kent 
OL,7,Fbranch of the Campaign to Protect Rural
OL,8,FEngland, said: "It does not counter the
OL,9,Ffact that the road, any road, is       
OL,10,Fultimately bad for the environment."   
